  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rabo Equity&#x2019;s India Agri Business Fund 2 (IABF 2) is a private equity fund which invests in growing businesses across the agribusiness sector. This includes infrastructure, food processing, rural retail, and cold chain storage and distribution companies.The fund focuses on the food processing sector.</narrative>
  </description>
