   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">In December 2014, CDC committed $30 million in IABF 2.  The fund raised $150 million which it uses to back between 12 and 15 small and medium sized companies with equity investment sizes ranging from $5 million up to $30 million.  We hope to see a significant share of our investment benefiting the low-income states in India where a large number of agribusinesses are based.</narrative>
   </description>
